# Feature branch WIP

**Paused.** We commit on **`main` locally** and only `git push origin main` when the user says “push to main”. See `local-commits-push-main.mdc`.

Do **not** auto-push feature branches. If the user explicitly names another branch to push, push **only** that branch — never `origin/main`.
